# Frontend JavaScript

- **Vanilla JS only** — no frameworks. Entry points and load order are documented in [docs/FRONTEND_SCRIPT_MANIFEST.md](../../docs/FRONTEND_SCRIPT_MANIFEST.md).
- Scripts are loaded via `<script src="">` in HTML; do not remove or rename files that are listed in the manifest without updating the manifest and HTML.
- **Layout mode:** [`layout-mode.js`](../js/layout-mode.js) sets **`layout-mobile`** / **`layout-desktop`** on `<html>` via `matchMedia` (**max-width 900px**) and optional `localStorage` `preferDesktopLayout`. Use **`window.isLayoutMobile()`** for JS branches; listen for **`layout-mode-change`** when layout must reflow (e.g. deck list columns, DBV table reflow if needed). See [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md).
- **Characters DBV stat filter tabs:** [`characters-stat-filter-tabs.js`](../js/characters-stat-filter-tabs.js) (load in `<head>` after `layout-mode.js` on `index.html`; also `deck-builder.html` with `layout-mode.js` + `mobile-layout.css`) toggles **`.is-active`** on **`.characters-stat-panel`** when **`layout-mobile`** so only one stat’s **`= / Min / Max`** row shows; desktop shows all five via CSS. **`syncEqualsInputPlaceholders()`** sets **`.filter-input.equals`** **`placeholder`** to **`Equals`** on **`layout-mobile`**, **`=`** on desktop (on init + **`layout-mode-change`**). **Mobile Clear:** **`#clear-filters-mobile`** in **`.characters-filter-clear-inline`**; **`search-filter-functions.js`** wires **`#clear-filters`** and **`#clear-filters-mobile`** to **`clearAllFilters`**.

## Card Database (DBV) — where logic lives

- **DOM:** `#database-view` in [`public/index.html`](../index.html); template fetch paths include [`templates/database-view-complete.html`](../templates/database-view-complete.html) (see [`template-loader.js`](template-loader.js)).
- **Scripts in main SPA load order** (see manifest): **`card-display.js`**, **`all-cards-display.js`**, **`search-filter.js`**, **`modal-ui.js`**, **`card-display-functions.js`**, **`search-filter-functions.js`**, **`filter-functions.js`**, **`event-binder.js`**, **`card-data-display.js`**, plus wiring in **`app-initialization.js`**, **[`components/globalNav.js`](../components/globalNav.js)**, **`auth-app-init.js`**.
- **Global nav JS:** [`globalNav.js`](../components/globalNav.js) — **`syncHeaderCollectionLayout()`** keeps **`.collection-tab-hidden`** on **`.header-app-actions`** in sync when Collection is hidden (logged out); invoked from **`updateUserWelcome()`**. Do not reintroduce **`display: none`** on Collection without updating mobile grid layout. See [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) **§10.1**.
- **Mobile:** Prefer styling under **`html.layout-mobile`** in [`mobile-layout.css`](../css/mobile-layout.css); use **`isLayoutMobile()`** / **`layout-mode-change`** only when JS must react (e.g. re-measure, swap layout).
- **`database-view.js`**, **`database-view-core.js`**, **`database-view-tabs.js`**, **`database-view-search.js`**, **`database-view-display.js`:** listed as **orphaned** in the script manifest (not loaded by `index.html`). Treat as historical unless an HTML entry point wires them in—do not assume they run in production.
- **M2c Characters (mobile):** `displayCharacters` sets **`data-label`** on character **`td`** cells except the **actions** column (**`td:nth-child(2)`**, no label); **`mobile-layout.css`** hides **`tbody td:nth-child(n+3)`** (name/stats) so rows show **image + actions** only. **Image cell** includes **`characters-mobile-card-caption`** (line 1 = full **`name`**; line 2 = **`special_abilities`** when non-empty — **`.characters-mobile-card-caption__ability`**; line 3 = **`translateSet(set)`** + **`set_number`**; **`navigateCardImage`** updates all lines). **`applyDbvHorizontalCardClass`** toggles **`horizontal-card`** on character **`img`** (All-tab parity: landscape **`max-height: 300px`**) on initial **`load`** and after **`navigateCardImage`** **`src`** changes. **`applyCharacterImageRowHeightLock`** / **`clearCharacterRowHeightLocks`** / **`layout-mode-change`** keep desktop row locks off when `isLayoutMobile()`. See `mobile-layout.css` **Characters tab — card rows** (actions grid matches **All** tab).
- **M2c Special Cards (mobile):** Thead layout and **`width: … !important`** overrides live in **`mobile-layout.css`** (flex **`order`** for filter rows; full-width **`th`** vs **`database-view.css`**). **`displaySpecialCards`**: **`data-label`** on tbody **`td`** (not actions); **`.characters-mobile-card-caption`**, **`specialMobileCaption()`** / **`mobileCaption`** on **`imageData`** for **`navigateCardImage`**, height locks + **`layout-mode-change`**. **Clear:** **`clearSpecialCardFilters()`** via **`#clear-special-filters-mobile`**. See **`MOBILE_DESIGN.md` §10.3**. Row art / **`#imageModal`** sizing attempts: [`docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_CARD_IMAGE_TRIES.md`](../../docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_CARD_IMAGE_TRIES.md).
- **M2c Aspects (mobile):** **`displayAspects`** in **`card-display-functions.js`** — **`aspectUseMobileListArt()`** ( **`isLayoutMobileForCardDisplay()`** or **`isNarrowViewportDbvBand()`** from **`card-display.js`** on **`window`**); mobile **caption** **`characters-mobile-card-caption`** (name → location → plain effect → optional **Fortification!** / **One Per Deck**); **actions `td`** has **no `data-label`** (no teal **ACTIONS** row label). **`data-dbv-lightbox-context="aspect"`**. CSS: **`mobile-layout.css`** **Aspects tab** block; **`#aspects-table`** no-value face chrome in **`database-view.css`**. **`card-display-functions.js`** tail assigns **`window.displayLocations`** from **`card-display.js`** load order — do not eval this file in isolation without a **`displayLocations`** stub. Spec: [`docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md). Tests: [`tests/unit/dbv-aspects-mobile.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/dbv-aspects-mobile.test.ts).
- **M2c Missions (mobile):** **`displayMissions`** — **`missionUseMobileListArt()`** (same layout/narrow helpers as Aspects); **`card-image-container`**, **`data-dbv-lightbox-context="mission"`**, caption **name → `mission_set` → `dbvSetCaptionLineFromCard`** (**`window.dbvSetCaptionLineFromCard`** from **`card-display.js`**). **Filters:** **`populateMissionsMissionSetSelect`**, **`applyMissionFilters`**, **`missionsFilterUsesMobileSelect`** in **`search-filter-functions.js`**; **`loadMissions`** (**`card-data-display.js`**) repopulates select then **`applyMissionFilters`**. **No** Missions-tab Clear button (use **All** / checkboxes / global clear). Spec: [`docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md). Tests: [`tests/unit/dbv-missions-mobile.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/dbv-missions-mobile.test.ts).
- **M2c Events (mobile):** **`displayEvents`** in **`card-display-functions.js`** — **`card-image-container`** (no art nav), **`data-full-res`**, caption **name → mission set → game effect → flavor** (**`characters-mobile-card-caption__flavor`** italic in CSS); **`applyDbvHorizontalCardClass`** + **`applyCharacterImageRowHeightLock`**. **Filters:** **`populateEventsMissionSetSelect`**, **`applyEventsFilters`** (same **`missionsFilterUsesMobileSelect`** branch as Missions for **`#events-mission-set-filter`** vs checkboxes; intersects **`#search-input`** when Events tab active + game effect header); **`loadEvents`** repopulates select then **`applyEventsFilters`**. **Clear:** **`clearEventsFilters`** / **`#clear-events-filters-mobile`**. CSS: **`mobile-layout.css`** Events block + **`#database-view #events-table`** mirror; **`database-view.css`** hides **`.events-mobile-set-row`** on desktop. Tests: [`tests/unit/dbv-events-mobile.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/dbv-events-mobile.test.ts), [`tests/unit/events-filtering-frontend.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/events-filtering-frontend.test.ts).
- **M2c Ally (mobile):** **`displayAllyUniverse`** / **`buildAllyMobileCaptionHtml`** in **`card-data-display.js`** when **`teamworkUseMobileListArt()`** — stacked caption under art; **`applyAllyUniverseFilters`** + **`window.allyUniverseData`** + **`.ally-stat-type-to-use-toggles`** in **`search-filter-functions.js`**. Tests: [`tests/unit/dbv-ally-mobile.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/dbv-ally-mobile.test.ts).
- **Universe: Basic (mobile):** **`displayBasicUniverse`** / **`buildBasicUniverseMobileCaptionHtml`** / **`basicUniverseUseMobileListArt`** in **`card-data-display.js`**; **`window.basicUniverseData`** in **`loadBasicUniverse`**; **`applyBasicUniverseFilters`** in **`card-filter-toggles.js`**; **`clearBasicUniverseFilters`** in **`filter-functions.js`**. Spec: [`docs/current/DBV_BASIC_UNIVERSE_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_BASIC_UNIVERSE_MOBILE.md). Tests: [`tests/unit/dbv-basic-universe-mobile.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/dbv-basic-universe-mobile.test.ts).
- **Mobile image sizing — `max-height` override required:** The mobile inline style path for special cards (`specialDbvImgStyle`) must **not** include `max-height: 180px` — the CSS handles sizing via `max-height: none !important`. When adding mobile support for other tabs, ensure the JS display function's mobile branch omits `max-height` from inline styles. See [`docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_TD_IMG_MAX_HEIGHT_FIX.md`](../../docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_TD_IMG_MAX_HEIGHT_FIX.md).
- **DBV All tab (mobile):** [`all-cards-display.js`](all-cards-display.js) renders **`#all-cards-grid-container`** cells; **do not** add inline **`grid-template-columns`** on that container (breaks single-column CSS). Per-cell action layout is CSS-only in **`mobile-layout.css`** (**`.card-content-bottom`** grid). [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) **§10.2**.
- **Viewport clamping:** [`viewport-positioning.js`](../js/viewport-positioning.js) exposes **`clampRectToViewport`** for flyouts/modals; prefer over ad hoc `innerWidth`/`innerHeight` when adding new floating UI.
- **Card hover modal** (`card-hover-modal.js`): Uses a single shared `#cardHoverImage` and optional `.card-hover-image-full` layer. On each `showCardHoverModal` call we **clear both layers first** (set `image.src = ''` and clear the full-res layer) before setting the new image URL(s), so the previous card is never shown while the new one loads (avoids "thumbnail locked to first hover" in collection/FOIL view). See [docs/card-hover-modal.md](../../docs/card-hover-modal.md).
- **Progressive image loading** (deck editor card-view and card hover modal): Two-layer pattern — thumb stays visible, full-res fades in on top. **Decode before reveal:** set the full-res layer's `src`, then await that layer's `decode()` (with a `.catch()` fallback) before adding the `--loaded` class. Full best practice: [docs/current/PROGRESSIVE_IMAGE_LOADING.md](../../docs/current/PROGRESSIVE_IMAGE_LOADING.md). Deck-editor specifics: [docs/current/DECK_EDITOR_IMAGE_LOADING.md](../../docs/current/DECK_EDITOR_IMAGE_LOADING.md).
- **Character Stacks (Available Cards)**:
  - Rendered in `public/index.html` as the first available-cards category (`type: 'character-stacks'`).
  - Subdivision name filtering is handled by `filterCharacterStacksByName()` (inline in `index.html`) and should only filter Character Stacks groups.
  - Batch add behavior is handled by `addAllCharacterStack()` in `deck-card-operations.js`.
  - `card-filter-toggles.js` must target categories by header label (e.g., `Special Cards`) when `.character-group` is shared by multiple categories.
  - UI behavior and selectors are documented in [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md) under "Deck Editor Available Cards Character Stacks".
- **DBV Special Cards — Icon, Value, and Function column filtering**:
  - **Icon column** (power type icons from `special_cards.icons TEXT[]`):
    - Cell rendering: `renderSpecialIconBadges()` in `card-display.js`; uses `POWER_TYPE_ICON_MAP` for PNG paths.
    - Header toggle buttons: `.power-type-filter-toggle[data-power-type]` in the `.special-power-filter-toggles` grid.
    - Filter logic in `search-filter-functions.js` (`setupSpecialCardSearch` → `performSpecialCardSearch`):
      - Single/multiple toggles → OR match against `card.icons` array entries.
      - `Multi-Power` toggle is special: matches cards with `card.icons.length >= 2` (not a literal string lookup).
      - `#special-no-icon-toggle` (checkbox, often visually hidden behind ban-icon face) → shows only cards with null/empty `icons`; disables all power type toggles.
    - Clear/reset in `filter-functions.js` (`clearSpecialCardFilters`): removes `.is-active`/`.is-disabled`, clears `disabled`, unchecks `#special-no-icon-toggle`.
    - Power type icon PNGs live in `src/resources/images/icons/` (energy, combat, brute_force, intelligence, any-power).
    - Power type icons and function icons are excluded from `makeImagesClickable()` in `modal-ui.js`.
  - **Value column** filtering: `#special-value-equals`, `#special-value-min`, `#special-value-max`, `#special-no-value-toggle` (visually hidden; ban-icon face in UI) — all in `setupSpecialCardSearch`. When checked, numeric inputs are disabled and only `NULL` value rows match.
  - **Function column** icon toggle filtering: `getSelectedSpecialFunctionFilterFields()` / `cardMatchesFunctionIconFilters()` — OR logic across selected boolean icon fields.
  - Combined filter order: `text AND value AND icon-type AND function-icons`.
  - Keep UI behavior docs in [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md).

## CDN Image URLs in DBV Display Functions — Required Pattern

**NEVER hardcode `/src/resources/cards/images/...` directly in `<img src>` attributes** inside DBV display functions (`displayMissions`, `displayEvents`, `displayAspects`, etc.). In production, card images are served exclusively from S3/CloudFront (Docker excludes `src/resources/cards/images/`), so hardcoded app-relative paths will 404.

**Always compute `imagePath` per card using `window.getCardImagePath`:**

```js
let imagePath;
if (typeof window.getCardImagePath === 'function') {
    imagePath = window.getCardImagePath({ ...card, image_path: card.image_path || card.image }, 'TYPE');
} else {
    const cdn = (window.APP_CDN_BASE || '').replace(/\/$/, '');
    const raw = '/src/resources/cards/images/TYPE/' + mapImagePathToActualFile(card.image || '');
    imagePath = cdn ? cdn + raw : raw;
}
const imagePathEscaped = imagePath.replace(/'/g, "\\'");
const imagePathAttr = imagePath.replace(/"/g, '&quot;');
```

Then use `imagePathAttr` in `<img src>` and `imagePathEscaped` in `onmouseenter`/`onclick`/collection button handlers.

**Why this works:** `/js/app-config.js` is loaded synchronously (no `defer`) before all other scripts, so `window.APP_CDN_BASE` is always set when deferred scripts execute. Module-level CDN constants (e.g., `_CARD_IMAGE_CDN_BASE` in `card-image-utils.js`, `CDN_BASE` in `deckTileImages.js`) are captured correctly because the IIFE/module runs after `app-config.js`.

**Files fixed (March 2026):** `displayEvents`, `displayMissions`, `displayAspects` in `card-display-functions.js`. The `displayAdvancedUniverse` function had the correct pattern and was the reference implementation. `displayLocations` and `displayPowerCards` in `card-display.js` already use `getCardImagePathForDisplay` which delegates to `window.getCardImagePath`.
